cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or its results, please cite both the software and the paper it accompanies."
title: "htw-pdm: Point Defect Model identification for X6CrNiNb18-10 in BWR hydrothermal water"
abstract: >-
  Mechanistic identification of passive-film growth kinetics on Nb-stabilized
  AISI 347 (X6CrNiNb18-10) in boiling-water-reactor hydrothermal water at
  240 C, 7 MPa and 0.4 ppm dissolved oxygen, fitted to published oxide depth
  profiles at three exposure times. Includes the classical fits and model
  ladder, a differentiable physics-informed inversion, profile-likelihood and
  bootstrap identifiability analysis, and the spatial extension.
type: software
version: 1.0.0
license: Apache-2.0
